BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Linn County Youth Coalition Ice Cream Social & Mental Health Prese
 ntation
DTSTART:20260825T220000Z
DTEND:20260825T233000Z
DTSTAMP:20260818T074555Z
UID:bfchamber-linn-county-youth-coalition-ice-cream-social-mental-health-p
 resentation-2026-08-25-0500@linn-county-scraper.local
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for Ice Cream and Connection while we learn about
  mental health from Compass Health through a training called\, Erica’s L
 ighthouse\, it takes 45 Minutes. The target Audience for the training is M
 iddle School\, but we are welcoming 5th through 12th grade for the Ice Cre
 am Social! We will learn more about mental health & ways to keep your mind
  healthy\, the difference between everyday feelings\, and overwhelming fee
 lings.For more information contact Kamber Fusco at kamber.a.fusco@dss.mo.g
 ov
LOCATION:Linn County Health Department | Brookfield\, MO
END:VEVENT
